{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20290","headline":"少年行 · 张籍","name":"少年行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年从猎出长杨，禁中新拜羽林郎。\n独对辇前射双虎，君王手赐黄金璫。\n日日鬬鸡都市里，赢得宝刀重刻字。\n百里报仇夜出城，平明还在娼楼醉。\n遥闻虏到平陵下，不待诏书行上马。\n斩得名王献桂宫，封侯起第一日中。\n不爲六郡良家子，百战始取边城功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}